{"pageProps": {"params": {"versionId": "59", "usfm": "2TI.1.NIV"}, "audioVersionInfo": {"title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "copyright_long": {"text": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament", "html": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament"}, "copyright_short": {"text": "\u2117 2016 Crossway", "html": "<p>\u2117 2016 Crossway</p>"}, "version_id": 59, "id": 1, "publisher_link": "", "dramatized": false, "publisher": {"id": 575, "name": "Hear Book Audio", "local_name": "Hear Book Audio", "url": null, "description": null}}, "type": "chapter", "chapterInfo": {"audioChapterInfo": [{"download_urls": {"format_mp3_32k": "//audio-bible-cdn.youversionapi.com/1/32k/2TI/1-dde466c694c13d4a341e4fed762062a7.mp3?version_id=59", "format_hls": "//audio-hls.youversionapi.com/1/m4a/32k/2TI/1-dde466c694c13d4a341e4fed762062a7.m3u8?version_id=59"}, "id": 1, "version_id": 59, "title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "timing_available": true, "dramatized": false, "default": true}, {"download_urls": {"format_mp3_32k": "//audio-bible-cdn.youversionapi.com/1668/32k/2TI/1-d7b5f7af6591f1dff819ff9c1b280b87.mp3?version_id=59", "format_hls": "//audio-hls.youversionapi.com/1668/m4a/32k/2TI/1-d7b5f7af6591f1dff819ff9c1b280b87.m3u8?version_id=59"}, "id": 1668, "version_id": 59, "title": "Living Water Bible - ESV Music Project by Lutheran Bible Translators", "timing_available": false, "dramatized": true, "default": false}], "content": "<div class=\"version vid59 iso6393eng\" data-vid=\"59\" data-iso6393=\"eng\">\n    <div class=\"book bk2TI\">\n        <div class=\"chapter ch1\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1\">\n            <div class=\"label\">1</div><div class=\"s1\"><span class=\"heading\">Greeting</span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.1\"><span class=\"label\">1</span><span class=\"content\">Paul, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See 2 Cor. 1:1 </span></span><span class=\"content\">an apostle of Christ Jesus </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See 1 Cor. 1:1 </span></span><span class=\"content\">by the will of God according to </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Titus 1:2; Heb. 9:15</span></span><span class=\"content\">the promise of the life that is in Christ Jesus,</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.1\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.2\"><span class=\"label\">2</span><span class=\"content\">To Timothy, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Cor. 4:17; [ch. 2:1]; See 3 John 4 </span></span><span class=\"content\">my beloved child:</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.2\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See 1 Tim. 1:2  </span></span><span class=\"content\">Grace, mercy, and peace from God the Father and Christ Jesus our Lord.</span></span></div><div class=\"s1\"><span class=\"heading\">Guard the Deposit Entrusted to You</span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.2\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.3\"><span class=\"label\">3</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See Rom. 1:8   </span></span><span class=\"content\">I thank God </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Acts 22:3; 24:14 </span></span><span class=\"content\">whom I serve, as did my ancestors, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Tim. 3:9; See Acts 23:1 </span></span><span class=\"content\">with a clear conscience, as I remember you </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Rom. 1:9</span></span><span class=\"content\">constantly in my prayers night and day. </span></span><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.4\"><span class=\"label\">4</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Acts 20:37] </span></span><span class=\"content\">As I remember your tears, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Phil. 1:8; [ch. 4:9, 21]</span></span><span class=\"content\">I long to see you, that I may be filled with joy. </span></span><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.5\"><span class=\"label\">5</span><span class=\"content\">I am reminded of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Rom. 12:9; 1 Tim. 1:5 </span></span><span class=\"content\">your sincere faith, a faith that dwelt first in your grandmother Lois and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Acts 16:1; [ch. 3:15; Ps. 86:16; 116:16]</span></span><span class=\"content\">your mother Eunice and now, I am sure, dwells in you as well. </span></span><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.6\"><span class=\"label\">6</span><span class=\"content\">For this reason I remind you </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Tim. 4:14; [1 Thess. 5:19]</span></span><span class=\"content\">to fan into flame the gift of God, which is in you through the laying on of my hands, </span></span><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.7\"><span class=\"label\">7</span><span class=\"content\">for God gave us </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Rom. 8:15; [John 14:27; Rev. 21:8] </span></span><span class=\"content\">a spirit not of fear but </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Luke 24:49; Acts 1:8</span></span><span class=\"content\">of power and love and self-control.</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.8\"><span class=\"label\">8</span><span class=\"content\">Therefore </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Mark 8:38 </span></span><span class=\"content\">do not be ashamed of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See 1 Cor. 1:6 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the testimony about our Lord, nor of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ver. 16]; See Eph. 3:1 </span></span><span class=\"content\">me his prisoner, but </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 2:3, 9; 4:5</span></span><span class=\"content\">share in suffering for the gospel by the power of God, </span></span><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.9\"><span class=\"label\">9</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Tim. 1:1; Titus 3:4 </span></span><span class=\"content\">who saved us and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Heb. 3:1]; See Rom. 8:28 </span></span><span class=\"content\">called us to</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">1:9 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">with</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> a holy calling, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Titus 3:5; See Rom. 3:27 </span></span><span class=\"content\">not because of our works but because of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Heb. 3:1]; See Rom. 8:28 </span></span><span class=\"content\">his own purpose and grace, which he gave us in Christ Jesus </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Titus 1:2; [Rom. 16:25]; See Eph. 1:4</span></span><span class=\"content\">before the ages began,</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">1:9 </span><span class=\"ft\">Greek </span><span class=\"fq\">before times eternal</span></span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.10\"><span class=\"label\">10</span><span class=\"content\">and which now has </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Rom. 16:26 </span></span><span class=\"content\">been manifested through </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See 2 Thess. 2:8 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the appearing of our Savior Christ Jesus, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Cor. 15:26; [1 Cor. 15:54, 55; Heb. 2:14, 15] </span></span><span class=\"content\">who abolished death and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Job 33:30] </span></span><span class=\"content\">brought life and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Rom. 2:7</span></span><span class=\"content\">immortality to light through the gospel, </span></span><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.11\"><span class=\"label\">11</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See 1 Tim. 2:7</span></span><span class=\"content\">for which I was appointed a preacher and apostle and teacher, </span></span><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.12\"><span class=\"label\">12</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 2:9 </span></span><span class=\"content\">which is why I suffer as I do. But </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 8 </span></span><span class=\"content\">I am not ashamed, for </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Ps. 10:14; 1 Pet. 4:19] </span></span><span class=\"content\">I know whom I have believed, and I am convinced that he is able to guard until </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 18; ch. 4:8; See 1 Cor. 3:13 </span></span><span class=\"content\">that day </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Tim. 6:20</span></span><span class=\"content\">what has been entrusted to me.</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">1:12 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">what I have entrusted to him</span><span class=\"ft\">; Greek </span><span class=\"fq\">my deposit</span></span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.13\"><span class=\"label\">13</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 3:14; Titus 1:9; Rev. 3:3] </span></span><span class=\"content\">Follow </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Rom. 2:20; 6:17] </span></span><span class=\"content\">the pattern of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See 1 Tim. 1:10 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the sound</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">1:13 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">healthy</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> words </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 2:2 </span></span><span class=\"content\">that you have heard from me, in </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">1 Tim. 1:14</span></span><span class=\"content\">the faith and love that are in Christ Jesus. </span></span><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.14\"><span class=\"label\">14</span><span class=\"content\">By the Holy Spirit </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Rom. 8:9 </span></span><span class=\"content\">who dwells within us, guard </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[See ver. 12 above]</span></span><span class=\"content\">the good deposit entrusted to you.</span></span></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.14\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.15\"><span class=\"label\">15</span><span class=\"content\">You are aware that </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Acts 19:10; [ch. 4:10, 11, 16]</span></span><span class=\"content\">all who are in Asia turned away from me, among whom are Phygelus and Hermogenes. </span></span><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.16\"><span class=\"label\">16</span><span class=\"content\">May the Lord grant mercy to </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 4:19 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the household of Onesiphorus, for he often </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Philem. 7, 20 </span></span><span class=\"content\">refreshed me and was not ashamed of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ver. 8]; See Acts 28:20</span></span><span class=\"content\">my chains, </span></span><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.17\"><span class=\"label\">17</span><span class=\"content\">but when he arrived in Rome </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Matt. 25:36-40</span></span><span class=\"content\">he searched for me earnestly and found me&#8212; </span></span><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"2TI.1.18\"><span class=\"label\">18</span><span class=\"content\">may the Lord grant him to find mercy from the Lord on </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 12 </span></span><span class=\"content\">that day!&#8212;and you well know all the service he </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Heb. 6:10</span></span><span class=\"content\">rendered at Ephesus.</span></span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>", "copyright": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers."}, "next": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["2TI.2"], "human": "2 Timothy 2", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "previous": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["1TI.6"], "human": "1 Timothy 6", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "reference": {"usfm": ["2TI.1"], "human": "2 Timothy 1", "version_id": 59}}, "usfm": "2TI.1.NIV", "locale": "en", "versionData": {"audio": true, "copyright_short": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers."}, "id": 59, "language": {"iso_639_1": "en", "iso_639_3": "eng", "language_tag": "eng", "local_name": "English", "text_direction": "ltr"}, "local_abbreviation": "ESV", "local_title": "English Standard Version 2016", "publisher": {"name": "Crossway / Good News Publishers"}, "reader_footer": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p> \r\n<p>Sign up to receive news and updates about the ESV:</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Ve